{"ref":"BDB, דַּךְ","hw":"דַּךְ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דַּךְ</span></big>  <strong>adj. crushed, oppressed</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:21\" href=\"/Psalms.74.21\">74:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:10\" href=\"/Psalms.9.10\">ψ 9:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">10:18</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּ֑ו</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.28\">Pr 26:28</a> (Baer; edd. al. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּיו</span>)—poet.; always fig., <em>oppressed, distressed</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 9:10\" href=\"/Psalms.9.10\">ψ 9:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:18\" href=\"/Psalms.10.18\">10:18</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יתום</span>) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:21\" href=\"/Psalms.74.21\">74:21</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">עָנִי</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">אביון</span>); <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.28\">Pr 26:28</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּכָּו</span> = <em>those crushed by it</em> (a lying tongue).","next":"BDB, דַּכָּה","prev":"BDB, דכך"}